@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-8: Project Completion Evaluation and Certificate Generation (WF-19, WF-20)
|Student or Team Leader|
start
:Request completion evaluation\n(or all mandatory tasks reach Completed);
|System|
:Start evaluation;
|AI Supervisor|
:Evaluate phases, sprints, tasks and deliverables;
:List pending tasks, unverified deliverables\nand unresolved blockers;
|System|
:Check eligibility rules (including each\nteam member's individual requirements);
|AI Supervisor|
:Generate final project completion report;
|System|
if (All completion criteria satisfied?) then (no)
  :Report lists outstanding items;
  :Execution continues;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|AI Supervisor|
:Recommend completion and certificate eligibility;
|System|
if (Supervisor approval enabled?) then (yes)
  |Supervisor|
  if (Approve completion?) then (no)
    |System|
    :Return feedback to team;
    :No certificate created;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
else (no)
endif
|System|
:Confirm all configured completion conditions;
repeat
  :Generate certificate ID for next eligible member;
  :Store certificate with name, project title,\ncompletion date, ID and verification information;
repeat while (More eligible members?) is (yes)
note right
  A duplicate ID is rejected by the
  unique index and a new ID is generated.
end note
|Student or Team Leader|
:View and download own certificate;
stop
@enduml
